  <Id>k__BackingField: thunderstorm
  <Title>k__BackingField: Thunder!
  <Icon>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 30f8c198df77b49b0908770b44ee5364, type: 3}
  <Description>k__BackingField: Lightning flashes over the hills and heavy rain starts
    to pour. You are on an open ridge.
  <Weight>k__BackingField: 1
  <MaxOccurrences>k__BackingField: 1
  <Trigger>k__BackingField: 0
  <Choices>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Get down into the forest and wait
    <RequiredItem>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
    <Outcome>k__BackingField:
      <Text>k__BackingField: You crouch low between small trees until the storm moves
        on. Wet, but safe.
      <Effects>k__BackingField:
      - rid: 6632890833693573275
    <Risk>k__BackingField:
      <Chance>k__BackingField: 0
      <ReducedBy>k__BackingField: []
      <Outcome>k__BackingField:
        <Text>k__BackingField: 
        <Effects>k__BackingField: []
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Hurry on over the ridge
    <RequiredItem>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
    <Outcome>k__BackingField:
      <Text>k__BackingField: You make it over the ridge, soaked and with your heart
        pounding.
      <Effects>k__BackingField:
      - rid: 6632890833693573276
    <Risk>k__BackingField:
      <Chance>k__BackingField: 0.3
      <ReducedBy>k__BackingField: []
      <Outcome>k__BackingField:
        <Text>k__BackingField: Lightning strikes a tree nearby. You throw yourself
          on the rocks and get hurt.
        <Effects>k__BackingField:
        - rid: 6632890833693573277
